@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Search service
+
+Product search for the Astronomy Shop: `POST /api/search` with `{"query": "..."}`
+(routed by frontend-proxy). It indexes the catalog from product-catalog
+(`ListProducts`, refreshed every `CATALOG_REFRESH_S`, default 60 s) and returns
+up to 6 matching products plus popular-product suggestions, 8 products in total.
+
+Matching: `match_mode` in `/tmp/search.conf` (`any`, the default, is tokenised
+term matching across name, categories and description; `phrase` is stricter,
+needing the whole query as a phrase in the name or categories).
+
+Telemetry: an HTTP server span per request and a `search_products` span with
+`app.search.query`, `app.search.results.count` and
+`app.search.results.product_ids`; gRPC client spans to product-catalog. Logs at
+startup and on errors only.
+
+Env: `SEARCH_PORT` (8090), `PRODUCT_CATALOG_ADDR`, `OTEL_*`.
diff --git a/src/search/matcher.py b/src/search/matcher.py
